}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List ASH Exit Records

  Returns a paginated list of ASH exit records, ordered by creation date.

  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.

  ## Query Parameters

  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Default | Description                     |
  |-----------|--------|----------|---------|---------------------------------|
  | page      | number | No       | `1`     | Page number (integer ≥ 1)       |
  | limit     | number | No       | `25`    | Items per page (integer, 1–100) |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`** — Returns a paginated array of ASH exit records.

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": [ ... ],
    "meta": {
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 25
      }
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  | Status                      | Description                                         |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid query parameters (e.g. non-numeric `page`). |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                            |
}
